<title>USA: NYSE suspends Westmoreland, moves to delist.</title>
<headline>NYSE suspends Westmoreland, moves to delist.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Wednesday it suspended trading in shares of Westmoreland Coal Co, and will seek to have the company delisted.</p>
<p>Trading also was suspended on Westmoreland's depository shares, which have traded under the symbol WCXprA.</p>
<p>Westmoreland last month filed for protection under Chapter 11 of the U.S. Bankruptcy Code.</p>
<p>	   ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
